          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(1) 和積公式で共通因子を作る",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "分母のsin40°をcos50°に直すと、分子と分母のどちらにもcos5°が現れます。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\cos25^\\circ+\\cos35^\\circ=2\\cos30^\\circ\\cos5^\\circ",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\sin40^\\circ+\\cos40^\\circ=2\\cos45^\\circ\\cos5^\\circ",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\frac{2\\cos30^\\circ\\cos5^\\circ}{2\\cos45^\\circ\\cos5^\\circ}=\\frac{\\sqrt6}{2}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(2) 2本の放物線式から二次項を消す",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "共有点では2本の式が同時に成り立ちます。第1式の2倍と第2式の3倍を加え、x²を消します。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "5y=37x+11\\quad\\Rightarrow\\quad y=\\frac{37}{5}x+\\frac{11}{5}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "tokyo-medical-2025-general-mathematics-answers-p002",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "note",
            "label": "なぜ加減してよいか",
            "text": "2曲線の共通点では両方の方程式が0なので、その定数倍の和も0です。二次項が消える組合せを選べば、共通2点を通る直線が残ります。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "f=y-3x^2+4x+5",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "g=y+2x^2-15x-7",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "kf+g=0",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "k=2/3とすればx²の係数が0です。原本の別解はこの一般形から同じ直線を得ています。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "tokyo-medical-2025-general-mathematics-answers-p003",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(3) 根号を絶対値へ直して区間を分ける",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\sqrt{x^2-2x+1}=\\sqrt{(x-1)^2}=|x-1|",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\int_0^4x|x-1|\\,dx",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "=\\int_0^1x(1-x)\\,dx+\\int_1^4x(x-1)\\,dx",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "=\\frac{41}{3}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(4) 1の5乗根を因数分解に並べる",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "x^5-1=(x-1)(x-\\omega)\\cdots(x-\\omega^4)",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "x=2を代入すると、求める4因子の前に2-1=1が付きます。したがって値は2^5-1=31です。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 2,
            "text": "第2問　要素ごとの配置で数える",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "answer_key",
            "items": [
              {
                "label": "(1)",
                "value": "アイウ 256"
              },
              {
                "label": "(2)",
                "value": "エオカキ 6561"
              },
              {
                "label": "(3)",
                "value": "クケコサ 6561"
              }
            ],
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(1) 各要素は入るか入らないか",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "2^8=256",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "空集合もA自身も部分集合に含めます。8個の要素ごとに2択なので256個です。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "crop",
            "asset_id": "ans-q2-subset-diagram",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "tokyo-medical-2025-general-mathematics-answers-p004",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(2) B⊂Cを3つの置き場所で数える",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "structured_list",
            "style": "cases",
            "items": [
              {
                "label": "場所1",
                "text": "Bに入る"
              },
              {
                "label": "場所2",
                "text": "Cには入るがBには入らない"
              },
              {
                "label": "場所3",
                "text": "Cの外にある"
              }
            ],
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "3^8=6561",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "crop",
            "asset_id": "ans-q2-nested-subsets",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(3) B∩C=∅も3つの置き場所",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "各要素はB、C、どちらにも入らない、の3択です。同じ要素をBとCの両方へ入れないので交わりは空です。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "3^8=6561",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "crop",
            "asset_id": "ans-q2-disjoint-subsets",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 2,
            "text": "第3問　桁数を10の冪で挟む",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "answer_key",
            "items": [
              {
                "label": "(1)",
                "value": "アイ 35"
              },
              {
                "label": "(2)",
                "value": "ウエオ 358"
              },
              {
                "label": "(3)",
                "value": "カ 4"
              }
            ],
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(1) 常用対数の整数部分を見る",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\log_{10}5^{50}=50(1-0.3010)=34.95",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "tokyo-medical-2025-general-mathematics-answers-p005",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "10^{34}<5^{50}<10^{35}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "10^34は1の後ろに0が34個、つまり35桁です。したがって5^50も35桁です。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(2) n²の桁数ごとにnをまとめる",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "structured_list",
            "style": "values",
            "items": [
              {
                "label": "1桁",
                "text": "1≤n≤3：3個"
              },
              {
                "label": "2桁",
                "text": "4≤n≤9：6個"
              },
              {
                "label": "3桁",
                "text": "10≤n≤31：22個"
              },
              {
                "label": "4桁",
                "text": "32≤n≤99：68個"
              },
              {
                "label": "5桁",
                "text": "n=100：1個"
              }
            ],
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "1\\cdot3+2\\cdot6+3\\cdot22+4\\cdot68+5\\cdot1=358",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(3) 100桁の範囲を不等式にする",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "10^{99}\\le2^n<10^{100}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "99\\le0.3010n<100",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\frac{99}{0.3010}\\le n<\\frac{100}{0.3010}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "328.9…≤n<332.2…なので、整数nは329、330、331、332の4個です。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 2,
            "text": "第4問　高さごとの線分を回転する",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "answer_key",
            "items": [
              {
                "label": "(1)",
                "value": "ア 2 ／ イ 2 ／ ウ 2 ／ エ 1 ／ オ 1 ／ カ 2 ／ キ 1 ／ ク 2"
              },
              {
                "label": "(2)",
                "value": "ケ ⑧ ／ コ 8"
              },
              {
                "label": "(3)",
                "value": "サシ 16"
              },
              {
                "label": "(4)",
                "value": "スセ 12"
              }
            ],
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(1) 平行四辺形の頂点と辺AB上の点",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "C=B+D-A=(2,2,2)",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "tokyo-medical-2025-general-mathematics-answers-p006",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "(x,y,z)=(1,0,0)+u(-1,1,2)",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "=(1-u,u,2u)",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "z=tよりu=t/2です。したがって辺ABと平面z=tの交点Qは次の座標です。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "Q=\\left(1-\\frac t2,\\frac t2,t\\right)",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(2) 断面は同心円環になる",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "平面z=tでMを切ると線分QRです。これをz軸のまわりに回すため、QとRのz軸からの距離が内半径と外半径になります。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "r_Q(t)^2=1-t+\\frac12t^2",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "r_R(t)^2=10-2t+\\frac12t^2",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "外半径の方が常に大きいので断面は穴のある円、選択肢⑧です。z=1では半径平方の差が8なので面積は8πです。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "tokyo-medical-2025-general-mathematics-answers-p007",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(3) 断面積を高さで積分する",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "V=\\pi\\int_0^2\\{r_R(t)^2-r_Q(t)^2\\}\\,dt",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "=\\pi\\int_0^2(9-t)\\,dt=16\\pi",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "(4) 原点から最も遠い点を探す",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "回転しても原点からの距離は変わりません。高さtで最も遠い点は線分QRの外側の端Rです。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "OP^2=t^2+r_R(t)^2=\\frac32t^2-2t+10",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "0≤t≤2で端点を比べるとt=2で最大です。値は12で、回転前の頂点Cの距離平方2²+2²+2²とも一致します。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "crop",
            "asset_id": "ans-q4-distance-section",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "tokyo-medical-2025-general-mathematics-answers-p008",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "crop",
            "asset_id": "ans-q4-distance-alternative",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 3,
            "text": "別解と本番での優先順位",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "別解では平行四辺形を含む平面へ原点から垂線を下ろし、平面内で垂線の足から最も遠い頂点を探します。4頂点の原点距離平方は1、5、12、10なので最大はCの12です。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "note",
            "label": "60分の使い方",
            "text": "第1問、第2問、第3問(1)(3)、第4問(1)を先に確保します。第3問(2)と第4問(2)(3)を次に扱い、第4問(4)は図形像が見える場合だけ最後に進みます。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          },
          {
            "type": "note",
            "label": "人間確認待ち",
            "text": "この解説は原本の解法順と答えを維持した編集案です。科目担当者による数式・答案表現・戦略の最終確認が必要です。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-04"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
